Files that port or adapt code from vision-demos say so in their header and
name the source file. Algorithms were reimplemented rather than copied
verbatim unless a header says otherwise. See docs/04-reference-coverage.md for
the mapping.

Third-party models and libraries (verified 2026-09-28; see
docs/08-assumptions-risks.md for the evidence and open questions):

  MediaPipe Tasks Vision (com.google.mediapipe:tasks-vision), Apache-2.0.
  MediaPipe Pose Landmarker model (BlazePose GHUM 3D), Apache-2.0 per its
    model card. The model card states the intended use is single-person video.
  SAM 3.1 (facebook/sam3.1), Meta "SAM License" (custom; commercial use
    permitted with restrictions). Only used via a server-side provider adapter.
  ViTPose+ Large (usyd-community/vitpose-plus-large), Apache-2.0 weights;
    trained on datasets (AI Challenger, MPII) with their own terms. Only used via
    a server-side provider adapter, for baseline evaluation.
